{"unit_id":"sanlisanxun__dsh-plugin-nickname#caveat-1","repo":"sanlisanxun/dsh-plugin-nickname","commit":"ff40facbab2545415e5d94abf024ad6c801d415e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-nickname 将备注和界面偏好保存在浏览器 localStorage；该存储不可用时改用内存，因此内存中的数据不会作为持久偏好保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:64","lib/client.js:69"]}
